    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/private-label/shutterstock_1565452774.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #012638; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">PRIVATE LABEL AGING SUPPLEMENTS</span></h1>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 40px; color: #012638; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Healthy aging supplements built on the latest nutritional science.</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Aging is natural and unavoidable, but customers can influence how they age by consuming the right active compounds, nutrients, and micronutrients. Several essential nutrients help combat the effects of stress reactions in the body and help maintain vitality and overall health.</p>\n<a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Talk to Our Team</a></div>\n</div>"
