     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Build an aging supplement line with proven private label formulations.</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Customers in this category look for results across many areas: increased energy, strengthened immunity, reduced appearance of wrinkles, improved skin elasticity, and better cognitive function. The healthy-aging market rewards brands that can deliver on multiple of these benefits with science-backed formulations.</p>\n<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements, low minimums, and no set-up fees, you can build out a complete product line that fits your audience. Choose from our catalog of ready-to-launch formulations, customize the branding, and we handle manufacturing and fulfillment.</p>\n</div>"
     },
