     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.81 4.94 9 2.25l-.81 2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 3L2.5 8.75l2.69.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3 3l.81 2.69.81-2.69a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 3-3l2.69-.81-2.69-.81a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-3ZM18 7.5l-.51 1.71a3 3 0 0 1-2.03 2.03L13.75 11.75l1.71.51a3 3 0 0 1 2.03 2.03L18 16l.51-1.71a3 3 0 0 1 2.03-2.03L22.25 11.75l-1.71-.51a3 3 0 0 1-2.03-2.03L18 7.5ZM16.5 18.75 16.04 20l-.46 1.25-.46-1.25-.46-1.25.46-1.25.46 1.25Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Multi-benefit appeal</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Aging customers look for energy, immunity, skin, cognitive, and joint support all at once. One category, multiple LTV drivers. Strong fit for brands building a multi-SKU line.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.75 3.1v5.66m4.5-5.66v5.66m-4.5 0a3.38 3.38 0 0 1-1.5 6.43m6-6.43a3.38 3.38 0 0 0 1.5 6.43M4.5 19.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5 4.5h6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5-4.5v-4.31a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5h-6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5 4.5v4.31Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Advanced formulations drive premium price</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Next-generation processing (liposomal delivery, synergistic blends, proprietary combinations) commands premium price points. Your customers will pay for proven absorption.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M21 8.25c0-2.49-2.02-4.5-4.5-4.5-1.83 0-3.4 1.09-4.13 2.66A4.49 4.49 0 0 0 7.5 3.75 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3 8.25c0 6.97 9 12 9 12s9-5.03 9-12Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Long-term customer relationships</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Healthy aging is a long-term wellness journey. Customers stay loyal to brands that help them feel and look their best over years, not months.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
