     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div><img src=\"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/Private%20Label/Images/Healthy_Aging.jpg\" alt=\"Aging supplements\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div><div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">WHY Prexera FOR HEALTHY AGING</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Evidence-based formulations with premium ingredients and white-glove support.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">Private-label healthy aging supplements should be built on the latest research. Our R&D team designs formulations with clinically relevant ingredients at therapeutic levels, then layers in next-generation processing techniques (like liposomal delivery) where they meaningfully improve absorption. You get cutting-edge supplements with all the active compounds and no junk.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
